<title>USA: Great Train Store buys Florida shop.</title>
<headline>Great Train Store buys Florida shop.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Train Store Co said Tuesday it had reached an agreement to acquire The Train Depot, a Winter Park, Fla., train hobby store.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. The transaction is expected to close in the next few weeks, the company said.</p>
<p>The owner of Train Depot, Stewart Marshall, is joining the the company and will continue to manage the store.</p>
</text>
